cartridge "DEEP HALLS/AMY BIENVENU/2026"

' DEEP HALLS - an original 3D maze for the ColecoVision.
'
' Find the yellow door out of each of four halls, seen from inside in 3D.
' The view is ray cast (ray.asm): 32 rays a frame through a 16 x 16 map;
' each one's distance picks a ready-made column of 16 tiles, and the rows
' go to the hidden name table page, which is then shown (no tearing).
'
' House rules: joystick and button only; text in columns 2-29, rows 1-22;
' tiles from code 128 (tables.py); an original tune played once
' (tune.py); the frame loop keeps the NMI off outside the wait.
'
' Screen: row 1 the counters, rows 2-17 the view (all 32 columns), rows
' 19-21 a compass and news. Stick up/down walk, left/right turn; the
' button shows the map while held.

